digraph account_payable_process_37 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QFII" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QFII"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QFII" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--3. Document validation_QFII" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_QFII" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_QFII"
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_QFII"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_GIOW" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"AND_JOIN--3. Document validation_QFII" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_GIOW"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_GIOW" -> "schedule the payment"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_GIOW" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_OHN8" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_OHN8"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_OHN8" -> "stamp all documents"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_OHN8" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_OHN8" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_OHN8"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_OHN8"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_GIOW" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_OHN8" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_GIOW"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_GIOW"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_GIOW" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
Once sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, the next tasks should be gathering the receiving report and doubling check a three-way match, they should be done in parallel. 
Once all pre-tasks are executed, then the next tasks should be scheduling the payment and entering the invoice into the accounts payable account, they should be done in parallel. 
Once scheduling the payment occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: stamping all documents, storing in paid invoice file. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process, which begins when you send invoice to the vendor accounting department.
Once the delivery to the vendor accounting department occurs, a receipt should be created.
When the creation of a receiving report is completed, the next tasks should be the gathering of receiving report and double check a three-way match, they should be done in parallel.
Once all pre-tasks have been executed the next tasks should be scheduling the payment and submitting the invoice to the accounts payable, these should be done in parallel.
Once the payment has occurred, one or more of the following paths should be executed: stamping all documents, storing in the payable invoice file.
The process is now completed.
"
}
